{"title":"Accessories","description":"","products":[{"product_id":"travel-cup-holder","title":"Zeen Cup Holder","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eIf your idea of the outdoors includes farmers markets and shopping trips, check out these cup holders to make the most of your outings. The cupholder wraps around the elevating tube and rests against the max height block. The fabric cupholder can hold cups and bottles, but collapses against the frame for tight fits.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Zeen Go","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":39538431361205,"sku":"002-A9004-50","price":44.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/0234\/0277\/files\/prototypeCupholder.png?v=1738918431"},{"product_id":"trunk-lift-straps","title":"Trunk Lift Straps","description":"\u003cp\u003eA fabric accessory that helps make the car loading experience twice as easy while protecting your car and the Zeen. The trunk lift straps are designed to work with the Zeen, but can be used to haul much more!\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOne of the most common questions we get is the weight of the Zeen. At 42 pounds, many have asked how best to load into the car. Our Trunk Lift Straps r\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\" data-pf-type=\"Text\" class=\"sc-jQrDum heCnGO pf-258_\"\u003eeduces lift and lower weight by half (21 lbs.) and slides in and out of trunks easily with no pinched fingers. Compatible with any* 2003 and later car trunk, hatchback or SUVs. \u003ca title=\"Trunk Lift Straps\" href=\"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/595674935\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eVideo\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Zeen Go","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41356272861365,"sku":"002-A9002-60-01","price":120.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/0234\/0277\/files\/TrunkLoaderRedCStill.png?v=1765398254"},{"product_id":"zeen-travel-cover","title":"Zeen Travel Cover","description":"\u003cp\u003eThe Zeen Travel Cover is a fabric shell to keep the Zeen protected in transit. This cover features reinforced lifting points and still allows the Zeen to travel on four castering wheels.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Zeen Go","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42295026385077,"sku":"002-A9005-60","price":120.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/0234\/0277\/files\/1.png?v=1738919145"},{"product_id":"zeen-seat-pad","title":"Zeen Seat Cushion","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003eIncrease the comfort of your Zeen experience. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003e1.5\" thick of advanced memory foam material with a waterproof shell \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"\u003efits around the existing seat and cinches tight.  We recommend lowering the seat height adjustment down one level to accommodate for the thickness of the cushion.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDue to hygienic reasons, the Zeen Seat Cushion is \u003cstrong\u003enot refundable\u003c\/strong\u003e if the sealed bag it arrived in is opened.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Zeen Go","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43043006415029,"sku":"100010","price":130.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/0234\/0277\/files\/3.png?v=1738119604"},{"product_id":"zeen-footrest","title":"Zeen Footrest","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLimited Release |\u003c\/strong\u003e The storage bag for the footrest accessory can be attached to either the left or the right backrest tube, depending on user preference.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003eWhen purchasing, there are three dropdown options. Please leave the default \"Home Installation\" selection if you are not purchasing in the same cart as a Zeen, or have communicated with a Zeen Team representative about adding to an existing pending order. \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/1144632937\/21cf46da81\"\u003eInstallation Video\u003c\/a\u003e | \u003ca rel=\"noopener\" href=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/0234\/0277\/files\/919029_v1.pdf?v=1765559228\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eInstallation Instruction PDF\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Zeen Go","offers":[{"title":"Home Installation","offer_id":52049731944629,"sku":"100034","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Attached to Left","offer_id":52049731977397,"sku":"100034-01","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"Attached to Right","offer_id":52049732010165,"sku":"100034-02","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/0234\/0277\/files\/InstalledISO-1.png?v=1762355409"},{"product_id":"urethane-wheel-kit","title":"Urethane Wheel Kit","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cem\u003eCURRENTLY BACKORDERED - WILL SHIP AT A LATER DATE\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\"\u003eThese urethane shock-absorbing wheels feature an integrated dampening mechanism that \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\"\u003eminimizes vibration and softens the feel of bumps and uneven terrain. From paved streets and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\"\u003etextured walkways to tile and carpet, the wheels adapt to the environment to support a smoother, \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\"\u003equieter experience with the Zeen. This enhanced design brings an added layer of comfort and \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\"\u003econtrol for users who want their Zeen to handle varied surfaces with greater ease.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\"\u003eThis kit includes all four wheels, the hardware and spacers necessary for use with them, and the tools needed to make the swap. See our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/vimeo.com\/1154353097\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003ewheel swap video\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cspan data-usefontface=\"true\" data-contrast=\"none\" class=\"TextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"NormalTextRun SCXP200013054 BCX0\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: 'Aptos',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Aptos; mso-ligatures: standardcontextual; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"\u003eNote: Braking performance is reduced when using the Urethane Wheels in wet conditions. If you anticipate using the Zeen on wet surfaces and terrain with hills, we recommend using our standard Never-Flat Foam Wheels.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Zeen Go","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":51798947070133,"sku":"100038","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0555\/0234\/0277\/files\/PXL_20250915_162556342_2.jpg?v=1758638365"}],"url":"https:\/\/gozeen.com\/collections\/accessories.oembed","provider":"Zeen Go","version":"1.0","type":"link"}